<title>JAPAN: Toko Electric -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toko Electric -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.99		vs	   15.22</p>
<p> Operating	  381    million	  vs	  633    million</p>
<p> Current	    441    million	  vs	  708    million</p>
<p> Net		  313    million	  vs	  321    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.78 yen	  vs	   11.06 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toko Electric Corp manufactures power receiving-distribution equipment.</p>
</text>
